#: src/Integration.php:300
msgid "Tag in lowercase, without spaces (e.g. home, category-sticks). Format: that of the ad unit in IRIOS Media. Device: the same spot can have one row per device (desktop from 768 px wide). Position: Manual only, with [irios_display tag=\"TAG\"] anywhere on the site (also the home page), or automatic: category sidebar (desktop only), above the category grid, inside it, after the category products, before the product description or before the related products."
msgstr ""

#: src/Integration.php:337
msgid "Add position"
msgstr ""

#: src/Integration.php:338
msgid "One ad per row. The position is the place in the results grid: 1 is top left, counted in reading order (left to right, row by row). The same ad unit can take several positions. In the live search dropdown there is at most one ad, at the top: the one of the lowest position."
msgstr ""

